sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Sender
  participant R as Receiver
  S->>R: ProcessTransferOpRequest(metadata)
  R-->>S: Accept/reject
  R->>S: StartTransfer(op)
  loop each file/chunk
    S-->>R: FileChunk(relative_path, type, bytes, metadata)
  end
  R->>R: Reconstruct validated destination
  R-->>S: StopTransfer(success/error)
  S->>R: Cancel/Pause optional
